# Public production site URL — used to build the canonical link and
# absolute Open Graph / Twitter image URLs in index.html (via Vite's
# %VITE_SITE_URL% HTML env-replacement, see index.html <head>).
#
# Not a secret: this is committed on purpose so `vite build` always
# produces valid, absolute metadata URLs, whether run on Vercel or
# locally. It currently points at the live Vercel alias because no
# custom domain is connected yet.
#
# ACTION REQUIRED once a custom domain (e.g. blueicehomestay.com) is
# connected in Vercel: update this single value (both here and as a
# Production environment variable in the Vercel project settings, so
# a build triggered directly from Vercel picks it up too) — nothing
# else in the codebase needs to change.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://blueices-v2.vercel.app
